WEBVTT

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.120
C'mon, what's the problem?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:18.870
The usual.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.260
Well, that was fast.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.840
I figured you'd probably
be coming in sometime soon.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.650
Doesn't seem like you've been
waiting for me since yesterday.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:38.640
Obviously not.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.360
Fredi, could you come here?

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:44.740
Hey, hang on!

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.310
Cindy!

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.330
Sheesh, if you keep bothering
me, I'll never get any work done!

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.600
What's your problem with me?

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.300
Me, I don't like guys who chase me.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.270
Actually, I'm the type
who likes to do the chasing!

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:00.060
What are you talking about?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.230
So what kind of guy are
you looking for, then?

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:06.640
A real man! I like 'em
wild, sexy, and intelligent!

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.600
But still kind to women, and always relaxed.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.250
And he's gotta be cute.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.790
Like Dante!

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.220
Dante?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.110
Him.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.960
If you could become more like Dante,
I might think about going out with you!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.640
Hey, Cindy!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.010
She thinks that's a real man?

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.900
I don't get it...
What does Cindy see in that guy?

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.510
What the...?

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.850
Did I drink too much?

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.470
She's not here! She's not here!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.690
Where'd that woman go?!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.050
Oh, my. What's his deal?

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.030
No. Wait! This isn't...

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.250
Forget about that guy!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.110
What happened to your face?!

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:18.490
Ow!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:25.640
Cindy, listen and listen good.
That Dante guy is no "real man."

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.110
He's nothing but a pervert!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:28.680
What?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.250
I saw it with my own eyes!
He went into the girls' restroom!

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.180
What are you talking about?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.970
What I'm saying is that he
picked up some girl at this club,

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:40.720
took her to the women's restroom and...

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.670
Dammit!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:57.070
Dammit... I swear I'm
going to get the dirt on you.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.830
Hey, what d'ya think you're doing?!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.970
Uh, n-n-nothing...

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.660
Looks like business is slow as always, eh?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.110
Whatever... Let's see it.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.270
Now, take it easy. Look, here we go.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.980
Be careful.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.300
Like you give a shit...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.760
What the hell are you doing here, Dante?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.310
I came to give you a message...

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:25.230
"You guys don't need a thing like this."

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.780
No way! He's going to take on the Mafia?!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.710
H-He really did...

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.080
Wh-Who is this guy?!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.520
Is he out of his mind?!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.860
Stay away from that guy!

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.610
He's heartless and cold-blooded!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.110
It doesn't matter if it's the Mafia or whoever!
That dude will even kill people for money!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.350
It wouldn't matter if you had nine lives!

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:18.080
If you're with that guy, you'll just
get used and then riddled with holes!

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.140
"Riddled with holes"? That's awful!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.330
No, wait! You're misunderstanding me!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:25.870
Go home.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.910
Ah, don't be that way...

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.310
What the heck? The door isn't even locked...

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.920
This is what I should
have done in the first place.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.600
I don't care what it is...

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:56.260
I just need to find something that
will land this freak in the slammer.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:03.080
I could make your wish come true.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.670
Must be my imagination...

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:16.930
Naw... I'm the only one fit for that job.

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:21.140
You despise Dante, right?! Me too!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.490
You gotta let me out of here!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.560
You?! What the hell could you do?!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.990
I'll make this worth your while, little boy.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:35.600
Let me out of here, and I'll...

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.560
Don't listen to those morons!
Me, I'm the one you need!

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.600
--I'm the one who found this guy!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.180
--Ouch!
--I'm the one who found this guy!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.430
--Ouch!
--So get lost!

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.670
Hey! Let me out of here!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.850
What the hell were those things?!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.360
They're devils.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.970
Wh-Who are you?!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:13.510
I don't think you've got the right to ask
that, after breaking into someone's house.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:15.110
I... That's...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:20.350
Relax. I won't tell Dante.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:27.300
So, you want to know the
truth about Dante, don't you?

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:27.850
Huh?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.160
If so, I've got something nice for you.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.460
What is this?

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.310
Don't ask. Just take it and go.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.640
When you open it, you'll
know what Dante really is.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.470
Dante?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.840
You're home, aren't you?

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:47.140
Morrison told me...

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:50.030
--Huh?
--It sounds like you've made a bunch of money, haven't you?

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.890
Hey, it's true, Cindy!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:11.420
You gotta believe me! I
saw it with my own eyes!

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:16.160
That dude isn't normal!
There's something really weird about him!

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:20.420
You broke into Dante's
place when he wasn't there?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.760
That? Um... Well...

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:26.220
It's 'cause I wanted you to
know that he's dangerous...

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.500
Shame on you!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.270
Why did things turn out like this?

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.280
Owww...

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:46.520
Huh?

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.740
Huh? Dammit!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.370
Trying to make me look stupid...

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:17.730
My family have been pacifists
since my grandfather's time, but...

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.470
What, just a cat?

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:43.360
It's all right. Come on...

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.640
I'm not going to eat you or anything...

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.540
Wh-Who's that over there?

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.400
What the hell is that?!

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:36.480
There he is!

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.070
Run, you idiot!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.820
What nice timing...

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.010
Lately I've had nothing
to fight but weaklings.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.700
So I've been wanting to go up against
someone that can give me a bit of a workout!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.850
A dem... A demo...

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.340
All bark and no bite.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:25.140
It's true! You gotta believe me, Cindy!

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:30.660
I saw that dude hack a devil in two!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.280
And there's more! Listen!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.310
He's a devil! It's absolutely true!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.290
That guy's a devil himself!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.880
I can't believe you... Are you all right?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.820
The sun's high in the sky, but
it's like you're still half dreaming.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.260
Nonsense! I didn't dream up any of this!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.920
At any rate, that guy is...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.320
Welcome, Dante!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.220
Hey, settle down!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.260
Who's that? Your boyfriend?

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.950
I was actually thinking
about maybe dating him...

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.060
But he's been getting all weird lately.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.370
Maybe I just didn't put things right.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:34.400
All I meant was that I'd
like him to be more like you...

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.220
It looks like he misunderstood me.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:41.650
And now he says I should stay
away from you 'cause you're a devil!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.490
Well, he's got things about half right...

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:50.620
And he swears he saw
you kill a devil last night...

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:59.550
It's so stupid. It's just that I
wanted to be the one to chase him...

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.680
Oh, I'm sorry! You'll have the usual, right?

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.610
Yep, that's right.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.890
You sure can be a devil...

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:26.060
Who's the devil?!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.350
If you're going to lose
the money to me at pool,

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.580
wouldn't you be better off
just paying what you owe?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:34.260
Are you really that far in debt?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:38.140
I mean, some weird man's been
spying on your office lately, too.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.930
A weird man?

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:44.500
Yeah. But he seemed like a
total wimp, so I got rid of him!

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:46.600
That reminds me...

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:50.490
there was some visitor in your office
when I stopped by recently, too.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:51.580
A visitor?

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.260
Dammit!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.510
Oh crap!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.860
Dante!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.110
U-Um... behind you...

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.660
Dante!

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:45.880
You called?

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.180
--You ready?
--Huh?

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.950
Now the party really gets started.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:13.600
N-No! Stop!

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.440
All right, bring it on!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:41.650
Just a minute.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:43.790
You forgot something.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.990
If you're going to skip town,
you should at least let her know.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.640
If you don't she can't chase
you, even if she wants to.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.250
What do you mean by that?

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.220
Ask her yourself.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.720
Wait, you came all this way to tell me that?

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.420
I'm a devil.
I just hadn't had my fill of fun yet.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.740
Dante!

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:23.650
What are you?!

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:27.750
Who knows... Maybe you
should try asking God or someone.

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:48.750
I'll have the same!

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:50.230
Huh?

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:53.010
I said I want one of those, too!

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:56.300
All right!

00:21:57.430 --> 00:22:00.150
Fredi, one strawberry sundae!

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:05.000
You planning on eating with me?

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:05.800
Yeah.

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:07.930
There you go.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:16.560
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Here's your strawberry sundae!

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.900
This guy's a total dork.

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:03.760
I'm not sure when it started,

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:05.940
but before I knew it, I was
always listening to her songs.

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:11.350
More rudely than any man,
more delicately than any woman,

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:14.230
she sang of the sadness in human hearts.

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:18.870
If I ever get to meet her,
I'll probably thank her.

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:24.880
Because she made me realize that
even I have enough emotional depth

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:27.500
to understand songs.